(1185637, 148678, 31213, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Your models pulled it off for ya!  :)  I hate bad actors....these guys did pretty well.  Nice composure and decent exposure.  A flash may have compensated for the shadows on her fact and  darker side of her shirt.  It still works though.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great job!  Your models pulled it off for ya!  :)  I hate bad actors....these guys did pretty well.  Nice composure and decent exposure.  A flash may have compensated for the shadows on her fact and  darker side of her shirt.  It still works though.  Very nice.', '2005-02-21 04:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1185638, 147846, 27137, '<td valign="top">The two women give it a nice effect,  but it is not separation in my opinion</td>', 'The two women give it a nice effect,  but it is not separation in my opinion', '2005-02-21 04:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1185639, 148947, 27137, '<td valign="top">the whole pict is slightly out of focus</td>', 'the whole pict is slightly out of focus', '2005-02-21 04:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1185668, 148993, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done indeed.  The hand really jumps out in 3D.  It''s like the ones where people do it in PS, but you''ve managed (I assume) to do it for real.  Great shot.</td>', 'Very nicely done indeed.  The hand really jumps out in 3D.  It''s like the ones where people do it in PS, but you''ve managed (I assume) to do it for real.  Great shot.', '2005-02-21 04:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
