(1185777, 148551, 3032, '<td valign="top">This photo confuses the heck out of me. Just don''t see the relation between the flowers and the whatever it is in the background next to the tree. Forgetting that for a moment I think the composition is a bit tight.</td>', 'This photo confuses the heck out of me. Just don''t see the relation between the flowers and the whatever it is in the background next to the tree. Forgetting that for a moment I think the composition is a bit tight.', '2005-02-21 07:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
