(1185781, 148660, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice dark and grey mood that goes well with the wall, good depth and strength because of the lines. <br/>Sky looks like it has been dodged, that''s not a problem, but it looks a bit sloppy around the trees. Sometimes the magic wand selection tool can help with isolating the sky from dark objects. But perhaps it just is as it is, in that case you can forget the previous two sentences.</td>', 'Nice dark and grey mood that goes well with the wall, good depth and strength because of the lines. Sky looks like it has been dodged, that''s not a problem, but it looks a bit sloppy around the trees. Sometimes the magic wand selection tool can help with isolating the sky from dark objects. But perhaps it just is as it is, in that case you can forget the previous two sentences.', '2005-02-21 07:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1185782, 147898, 3032, '<td valign="top">Whhaaaaaa I wanna be a pilot when I grow up! Hmm, I have grown up, stupid eyes of mine didn''t cooperate. :(<br/>Great view, good photo. Would have been a nice one for the selfportrait challenge as well. :)</td>', 'Whhaaaaaa I wanna be a pilot when I grow up! Hmm, I have grown up, stupid eyes of mine didn''t cooperate. :(Great view, good photo. Would have been a nice one for the selfportrait challenge as well. :)', '2005-02-21 07:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
