(1185793, 148981, 3032, '<td valign="top">The style, the scene, the tone, the exposure. No guessing, no pbase-ing, hi Sher! ;)<br/>I like it how the light falls around the stones and the mood created by the dark shadows below and in the tree. The only thing I don''t like is the bright sky at the top. <br/>Hope you do well, seperation is a difficult theme imho, didn''t submit anything.<br/></td>', 'The style, the scene, the tone, the exposure. No guessing, no pbase-ing, hi Sher! ;)I like it how the light falls around the stones and the mood created by the dark shadows below and in the tree. The only thing I don''t like is the bright sky at the top. Hope you do well, seperation is a difficult theme imho, didn''t submit anything.', '2005-02-21 07:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
