(1186858, 148420, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great idea, dunno how you thought of that. Basic error with the horizon running downhill by a mile from left to right. Colour ok, lacking a little contrast and sharpness. Composition poor with the focal point almost dead center. Rule of thirds should apply here. Be lucky :)</td>', 'Great idea, dunno how you thought of that. Basic error with the horizon running downhill by a mile from left to right. Colour ok, lacking a little contrast and sharpness. Composition poor with the focal point almost dead center. Rule of thirds should apply here. Be lucky :)', '2005-02-21 17:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
