(1186959, 147542, 15207, '<td valign="top">In future challenges you may want to ensure you save at a higher JPG quality and ensure your ISO is at the lowest setting (on some cameras it''s 50, on others its 200). It looks like there is a ton of noise grain in this, almost like it was taken by a cell phone camera - which I know it wasn''t. I like the effect you''re trying to captuer here, but the image is far too pixelated and grainy.</td>', 'In future challenges you may want to ensure you save at a higher JPG quality and ensure your ISO is at the lowest setting (on some cameras it''s 50, on others its 200). It looks like there is a ton of noise grain in this, almost like it was taken by a cell phone camera - which I know it wasn''t. I like the effect you''re trying to captuer here, but the image is far too pixelated and grainy.', '2005-02-21 18:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
