(1187002, 148513, 15407, '<td valign="top">Great colors and a great play on a theme that I knew would be used a lot... I''ll be curious to see which camera you used,  The lighting was quite good so I''m sure that you would have been able to use the maximum apeture available to you to get a deep DOF. The angle needed to get a this composure would mandate the placement of the steak, so I''m wondering if the focus on the church could have been improved any?  (Likely not) although the manual on mine says that it will focus sharply all the way to infinity. This shot inspires me to test that with mine as it would have really knocked off my socks with a sharp focus on the church!</td>', 'Great colors and a great play on a theme that I knew would be used a lot... I''ll be curious to see which camera you used,  The lighting was quite good so I''m sure that you would have been able to use the maximum apeture available to you to get a deep DOF. The angle needed to get a this composure would mandate the placement of the steak, so I''m wondering if the focus on the church could have been improved any?  (Likely not) although the manual on mine says that it will focus sharply all the way to infinity. This shot inspires me to test that with mine as it would have really knocked off my socks with a sharp focus on the church!', '2005-02-21 18:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
