(1187287, 148919, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very nice set up, but the hot-spot on the glass rim is bothersome and the left side of the table cloth is blown out a bit.  I''m no expert, but since this is advanced editing, one thing to try is the dodge/burn tool, or a faster shutter.  The problem is with the dark grapes, exposure may be a problem.  Good job though.</td>', 'Very nice set up, but the hot-spot on the glass rim is bothersome and the left side of the table cloth is blown out a bit.  I''m no expert, but since this is advanced editing, one thing to try is the dodge/burn tool, or a faster shutter.  The problem is with the dark grapes, exposure may be a problem.  Good job though.', '2005-02-21 21:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
