(1187436, 148927, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''m fairly early in the scroll, but this is the third take I''ve seen on oil/water and I think the best so far. Simple, but a couple of contrasting colors and the reflection to add interest. My only suggestion is that while I like the offset glass, I would have left a little more space on the left than you did.</td>', 'I''m fairly early in the scroll, but this is the third take I''ve seen on oil/water and I think the best so far. Simple, but a couple of contrasting colors and the reflection to add interest. My only suggestion is that while I like the offset glass, I would have left a little more space on the left than you did.', '2005-02-21 22:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
