(1187465, 148641, 30959, '<td valign="top">You lost me at John. The cliche ruined a very effective photo. To me it would have been much more effective to have let me think "It''s a Dear John" letter rather than spoon feed it to me. Dear Ambrose, Theodore or even Walter would have been better... I would have supplanted John and thanked you for letting me think a bit. Never underate your audience, they will hold you accountable for it.</td>', 'You lost me at John. The cliche ruined a very effective photo. To me it would have been much more effective to have let me think "It''s a Dear John" letter rather than spoon feed it to me. Dear Ambrose, Theodore or even Walter would have been better... I would have supplanted John and thanked you for letting me think a bit. Never underate your audience, they will hold you accountable for it.', '2005-02-21 22:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187467, 148549, 33542, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but nice picture and articulation of the theme. What are they sitting on?</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but nice picture and articulation of the theme. What are they sitting on?', '2005-02-21 22:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
