(1187471, 148560, 30959, '<td valign="top">A good idea that did not carry well here. I would have liked to have see a pile of coins, stacked for counting and tabulated implying skin flinty hoarding with one showing the conflicting motto or any other presentation that challenged me a bit more. Make me think a bit when you go to so much trouble. Like the color and detail.</td>', 'A good idea that did not carry well here. I would have liked to have see a pile of coins, stacked for counting and tabulated implying skin flinty hoarding with one showing the conflicting motto or any other presentation that challenged me a bit more. Make me think a bit when you go to so much trouble. Like the color and detail.', '2005-02-21 22:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
