(1187720, 148095, 30959, '<td valign="top">This picture has me on the edge of my seat...never mind the train separating.. I am watinf for the man to be cut in half...heh.. great tension, focus, storyline, composition...top of my scoring list this time.</td>', 'This picture has me on the edge of my seat...never mind the train separating.. I am watinf for the man to be cut in half...heh.. great tension, focus, storyline, composition...top of my scoring list this time.', '2005-02-22 01:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1187722, 146945, 30490, '<td valign="top">Great idea to try to capture the seperation felt when our soldiers are away on duty.  This composition isn''t very impactful though.  Maybe a shot with the father writing a letter to the service person?</td>', 'Great idea to try to capture the seperation felt when our soldiers are away on duty.  This composition isn''t very impactful though.  Maybe a shot with the father writing a letter to the service person?', '2005-02-22 01:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
