(1188426, 148674, 30841, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the colors projected on the backdrop, however it seems the top 1/3 section has a crease in the backdrop. Initially I liked the disjointed angle of the reflection, but I think it would have been much more effective if the backdrop was curved, not creased. Aditionally the section to the right of the boxes looks to be out of place, where the entire background didn''t make it into the shot. Would have been a fantastic shot if that white back piece was really reflective, curved and covered the entire background.</td>', 'I like the idea of the colors projected on the backdrop, however it seems the top 1/3 section has a crease in the backdrop. Initially I liked the disjointed angle of the reflection, but I think it would have been much more effective if the backdrop was curved, not creased. Aditionally the section to the right of the boxes looks to be out of place, where the entire background didn''t make it into the shot. Would have been a fantastic shot if that white back piece was really reflective, curved and covered the entire background.', '2005-02-22 12:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
