(1191394, 147894, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now, i really like this -  a really striking visual sense of the graphic. The colouration doesn''t do a lot for me personally - I think that parallel of spae would have a greater impact if left alone, as it were: it''s quite weird, surrealistic, gothic enough, surely, without resort to these colours? It''s a wonderful composition too. As much for the sake of I think everyone else is going to vote this down horribly, I''m giving you a high score, but i really would rather not have the colour ;-)</td>', 'Now, i really like this -  a really striking visual sense of the graphic. The colouration doesn''t do a lot for me personally - I think that parallel of spae would have a greater impact if left alone, as it were: it''s quite weird, surrealistic, gothic enough, surely, without resort to these colours? It''s a wonderful composition too. As much for the sake of I think everyone else is going to vote this down horribly, I''m giving you a high score, but i really would rather not have the colour ;-)', '2005-02-23 17:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1191407, 148512, 6999, '<td valign="top">With a couple of reservations, I really like this shot; there''s an overall sense of noise in those blue/white planes that seems at odds with the serenity of the composition, and the line of the fence as it goes across to image right: the later is my biggest problem with it: could you have framed the shot differently I wonder? If only that line could have been pushed higher I think you;d have a really strong image - graphic, and yet very real, and very serene.</td>', 'With a couple of reservations, I really like this shot; there''s an overall sense of noise in those blue/white planes that seems at odds with the serenity of the composition, and the line of the fence as it goes across to image right: the later is my biggest problem with it: could you have framed the shot differently I wonder? If only that line could have been pushed higher I think you;d have a really strong image - graphic, and yet very real, and very serene.', '2005-02-23 17:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
