(1192352, 147883, 19010, '<td valign="top">While this is not a bad photo it I just don''t like it. I feel that it is a very creative and appropriate approach to meet the challenge. I also think that the fading effect was interesting. While this is an eye grabbing shot it just does not apeal to me. I feel that to much was lost using the technique you used to fade. The highlight are horrible and most of the photo is either oversaturated or burned out. I will acknowledge however that this was probably intentional and that it was necessary to acheive the desired effect. to be fair i''ll go with a 5 for this one.</td>', 'While this is not a bad photo it I just don''t like it. I feel that it is a very creative and appropriate approach to meet the challenge. I also think that the fading effect was interesting. While this is an eye grabbing shot it just does not apeal to me. I feel that to much was lost using the technique you used to fade. The highlight are horrible and most of the photo is either oversaturated or burned out. I will acknowledge however that this was probably intentional and that it was necessary to acheive the desired effect. to be fair i''ll go with a 5 for this one.', '2005-02-24 08:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
