(1192673, 148394, 2490, '<td valign="top">Lotsa egg shots - not your fault, so I''m not punishing you.  This would be better if the background were solid black without the textrure. 6</td>', 'Lotsa egg shots - not your fault, so I''m not punishing you.  This would be better if the background were solid black without the textrure. 6', '2005-02-24 12:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192676, 148715, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wow what blue! Is this a model of some sort?  It just doesn''t look like a sky, to me.</td>', 'Wow what blue! Is this a model of some sort?  It just doesn''t look like a sky, to me.', '2005-02-24 12:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192679, 148463, 2490, '<td valign="top">I do see something that has been separated, but the shot itself does not make me think "separation."  It is executed fairly well,  in light of the separation you were illustrating.  6</td>', 'I do see something that has been separated, but the shot itself does not make me think "separation."  It is executed fairly well,  in light of the separation you were illustrating.  6', '2005-02-24 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192681, 147846, 2490, '<td valign="top">Obviously this fits the challenge only by virtue of the title, which is acceptable to me, but you are probably getting slammed for it.  I think the shot would have been better if the girl had NOT been making eye contact at the moment you shot it.  It makes me uncomfortable, because it seems she doesn''t want to be photographed.  As a result, she becomes the subject of the photo, to me.  Her being the subject makes the cell phone a raw distraction.  It seems to be a very haphazardly composed shot, maybe a shot you were trying to sneak, and this leaves me somewhat disappointed in it.  5</td>', 'Obviously this fits the challenge only by virtue of the title, which is acceptable to me, but you are probably getting slammed for it.  I think the shot would have been better if the girl had NOT been making eye contact at the moment you shot it.  It makes me uncomfortable, because it seems she doesn''t want to be photographed.  As a result, she becomes the subject of the photo, to me.  Her being the subject makes the cell phone a raw distraction.  It seems to be a very haphazardly composed shot, maybe a shot you were trying to sneak, and this leaves me somewhat disappointed in it.  5', '2005-02-24 12:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192684, 148765, 2490, '<td valign="top">Try moving the background back and lighting it.  Plenty of tips relative to white backgrounds this week :)  6</td>', 'Try moving the background back and lighting it.  Plenty of tips relative to white backgrounds this week :)  6', '2005-02-24 12:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192686, 148931, 2490, '<td valign="top">I think you were trying for the motion blur.  I like it, but it needs to be more exaggerated to be really effective.  The bright spot at the top right is somewhat distracting as well.  I think a tighter crop would have been MUCH more punchy. 7</td>', 'I think you were trying for the motion blur.  I like it, but it needs to be more exaggerated to be really effective.  The bright spot at the top right is somewhat distracting as well.  I think a tighter crop would have been MUCH more punchy. 7', '2005-02-24 12:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192692, 148558, 2490, '<td valign="top">For some reason that I can''t easily pinpoint, this shot feels really flat.  I think the greens are too dominate, but the nearly monochrome foreground, which is really the subject, accentuate the dominate greens and leave this feeling like just another snapshot.  An early morning or late afternoon shot MIGHT have helped you get some depth and contrast, because this looks like a midday shot.  5</td>', 'For some reason that I can''t easily pinpoint, this shot feels really flat.  I think the greens are too dominate, but the nearly monochrome foreground, which is really the subject, accentuate the dominate greens and leave this feeling like just another snapshot.  An early morning or late afternoon shot MIGHT have helped you get some depth and contrast, because this looks like a midday shot.  5', '2005-02-24 12:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192694, 148520, 2490, '<td valign="top">Flame shots are, IMHO, very hard to do well.  The movement of the flame always results in a blur, and the flame is normally overexposed by 2 or 3 stops and everything else is underexposed.  I''m not going to vote you down because this is a flame shot - it''s done as well as can be expected.  The shot just doesn''t make me think of separation, sorry.  It actually makes me think of a union.  5</td>', 'Flame shots are, IMHO, very hard to do well.  The movement of the flame always results in a blur, and the flame is normally overexposed by 2 or 3 stops and everything else is underexposed.  I''m not going to vote you down because this is a flame shot - it''s done as well as can be expected.  The shot just doesn''t make me think of separation, sorry.  It actually makes me think of a union.  5', '2005-02-24 12:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192695, 148912, 2490, '<td valign="top">There''s definitely separation here, and the exposure is perfect.  It''s not a real attention getter, but your technical score is very good, IMHO.  7</td>', 'There''s definitely separation here, and the exposure is perfect.  It''s not a real attention getter, but your technical score is very good, IMHO.  7', '2005-02-24 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192697, 148954, 2490, '<td valign="top">This evokes a sadness in me.  The green is just too dominate, though, because it pulls my eyes very strongly.  Maybe a touch too much burned vignetting, too.  5</td>', 'This evokes a sadness in me.  The green is just too dominate, though, because it pulls my eyes very strongly.  Maybe a touch too much burned vignetting, too.  5', '2005-02-24 12:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192699, 148686, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a nice blue sky, and it''s VERY different from the dark wall.  A touch of fill flash would have bumped this up about 2 points for me, I think.  I like the theme! 7</td>', 'Wow, that''s a nice blue sky, and it''s VERY different from the dark wall.  A touch of fill flash would have bumped this up about 2 points for me, I think.  I like the theme! 7', '2005-02-24 12:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192705, 148691, 2490, '<td valign="top">Capturing posed people in a way that they look spontaneous and moving is difficult.  I would recommend just having them fight and argue, all the while shooting.  This looks a little too stiff and posed.  I also would have cropped MUCH tighter on the girl''s left, and been sure to include her entire shoe in the foreground.  Just me :)  Nice technical shot, though! 7</td>', 'Capturing posed people in a way that they look spontaneous and moving is difficult.  I would recommend just having them fight and argue, all the while shooting.  This looks a little too stiff and posed.  I also would have cropped MUCH tighter on the girl''s left, and been sure to include her entire shoe in the foreground.  Just me :)  Nice technical shot, though! 7', '2005-02-24 12:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192710, 148925, 2490, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Good use of the chain link, appropriate focus and DOF.  Colors are just blue enough to make me feel separated.  Excellent! 10</td>', 'Love this shot.  Good use of the chain link, appropriate focus and DOF.  Colors are just blue enough to make me feel separated.  Excellent! 10', '2005-02-24 12:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192712, 148474, 2490, '<td valign="top">Lotsa egg shots :)  Isn''t it amazing how we all think alike?  Reasonably good execution here, but the blurry fingernail bothers me.  Or maybe it''s egg gunk.  It still distracts, and I''m struggling to find a true "subject" here.  5</td>', 'Lotsa egg shots :)  Isn''t it amazing how we all think alike?  Reasonably good execution here, but the blurry fingernail bothers me.  Or maybe it''s egg gunk.  It still distracts, and I''m struggling to find a true "subject" here.  5', '2005-02-24 12:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192749, 148659, 19010, '<td valign="top">one of the better egg shots so far. Ver welldone from a technical stand point. Good lighting, color and focus. I do feet that it is a little week in the separation area however. In this paticular situation showing the separation of the shell, yoke, and white. Persnaly prefere to see the actual separation taking place. While this is not a shot I would frame for my wall it is still a very nice shot.</td>', 'one of the better egg shots so far. Ver welldone from a technical stand point. Good lighting, color and focus. I do feet that it is a little week in the separation area however. In this paticular situation showing the separation of the shell, yoke, and white. Persnaly prefere to see the actual separation taking place. While this is not a shot I would frame for my wall it is still a very nice shot.', '2005-02-24 13:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192753, 147904, 19010, '<td valign="top">Hmm it''s a bit dark and the wood grain looks to be a bit out of focus. I also have trouble seeing the "separation" in this shot. Not a bad shot probably would have done a little better if I could make the separation connection. As i it about average.</td>', 'Hmm it''s a bit dark and the wood grain looks to be a bit out of focus. I also have trouble seeing the "separation" in this shot. Not a bad shot probably would have done a little better if I could make the separation connection. As i it about average.', '2005-02-24 13:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192767, 148599, 19010, '<td valign="top">I like this shot .. I feel that the three glare spots will probably hurt you a bit however. Not very crisp and your DOF is too shallow despite all of this I just like it... I feel this fits the challenge very well. so bwahahaaaaa the technical rules can bite me you get a good score any way..</td>', 'I like this shot .. I feel that the three glare spots will probably hurt you a bit however. Not very crisp and your DOF is too shallow despite all of this I just like it... I feel this fits the challenge very well. so bwahahaaaaa the technical rules can bite me you get a good score any way..', '2005-02-24 13:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192774, 148984, 19010, '<td valign="top">Yup its separated.... fairly well executed. I feel that this could have used less shadows and a little more detail. As for the subject it''s a little bland IMO. Perhaps if this had been shot on a different color back groung it might have been more astheticly pleasing.. as is seems pretty average.</td>', 'Yup its separated.... fairly well executed. I feel that this could have used less shadows and a little more detail. As for the subject it''s a little bland IMO. Perhaps if this had been shot on a different color back groung it might have been more astheticly pleasing.. as is seems pretty average.', '2005-02-24 13:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192777, 148704, 19010, '<td valign="top">better than averge but not quite breathtaking. I do enjoy the thousands of tiney little branches you captured. The chaos is beautifull. I am forced to ask what are those between the trees? Tombstones. If so I feel there very appropriate. I think however it would have been nice to have them larger.  As for the composition. the trees on the right bother me.  and I don''t like the shadow on the foreground. Overall not a bad shot. but seems pretty average to me</td>', 'better than averge but not quite breathtaking. I do enjoy the thousands of tiney little branches you captured. The chaos is beautifull. I am forced to ask what are those between the trees? Tombstones. If so I feel there very appropriate. I think however it would have been nice to have them larger.  As for the composition. the trees on the right bother me.  and I don''t like the shadow on the foreground. Overall not a bad shot. but seems pretty average to me', '2005-02-24 13:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192780, 148850, 19010, '<td valign="top">woohoo color!! crisp focus and strong lines.. and it meets the challenge. I like it 8. might have gone with a 9 or 10 if the topic had been a little more exciting.. still one of my highest scores yet.</td>', 'woohoo color!! crisp focus and strong lines.. and it meets the challenge. I like it 8. might have gone with a 9 or 10 if the topic had been a little more exciting.. still one of my highest scores yet.', '2005-02-24 13:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192783, 147542, 19010, '<td valign="top">Interesting technique even if it dosn''t work for me. Fits the challenge well. as for color, focus and lighting.. wel I don''t like it..  but I will however acknowledge that that is just personal tast and it is obvious that this was an intentional effect.. Interesting and unusual.</td>', 'Interesting technique even if it dosn''t work for me. Fits the challenge well. as for color, focus and lighting.. wel I don''t like it..  but I will however acknowledge that that is just personal tast and it is obvious that this was an intentional effect.. Interesting and unusual.', '2005-02-24 13:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192786, 148505, 19010, '<td valign="top">I like the4 lighting and the details in this shot. The red hue throughout the shot works very well will the theme. I don''t however care for the loose strings on the bottom of the shot. Meets the challenge and is well done.</td>', 'I like the4 lighting and the details in this shot. The red hue throughout the shot works very well will the theme. I don''t however care for the loose strings on the bottom of the shot. Meets the challenge and is well done.', '2005-02-24 13:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192788, 148560, 19010, '<td valign="top">A coomon theme shot from a completely original angle. I like the originality of the shot I think that it would be improved however by either dilling a hole through the god. or using a more commanly accepted black masking to censor out the word. Overall not a bad shot stands a little ahead of most.</td>', 'A coomon theme shot from a completely original angle. I like the originality of the shot I think that it would be improved however by either dilling a hole through the god. or using a more commanly accepted black masking to censor out the word. Overall not a bad shot stands a little ahead of most.', '2005-02-24 13:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192806, 147829, 19010, '<td valign="top">Interesting and unusual. The first thing that strikes me as being off is the top leaf looks to out of focus..  It meets the challenge IMO but feels a little of. otherwise nice colors, for the most part it''s crisp and in focus. There are no shadows on your nice white back ground.. not a bad shot at all.. it just doeas not move me emotionaly so i''ll give you a 7.</td>', 'Interesting and unusual. The first thing that strikes me as being off is the top leaf looks to out of focus..  It meets the challenge IMO but feels a little of. otherwise nice colors, for the most part it''s crisp and in focus. There are no shadows on your nice white back ground.. not a bad shot at all.. it just doeas not move me emotionaly so i''ll give you a 7.', '2005-02-24 14:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192816, 148915, 19010, '<td valign="top">hey no fair I realy want to click the 9 button. The lines are just wonderfull. But then I started to take time and enjoy the shot. Quickly realizing the entire floer in the back is out of focus. I think that this could have use d just a little more lighting to bring out more of the details. The leaf looks like it would have a beautifull curve to it. so with a little more light and better focus you had an easy 9.. as is I cant bring myself above a 7</td>', 'hey no fair I realy want to click the 9 button. The lines are just wonderfull. But then I started to take time and enjoy the shot. Quickly realizing the entire floer in the back is out of focus. I think that this could have use d just a little more lighting to bring out more of the details. The leaf looks like it would have a beautifull curve to it. so with a little more light and better focus you had an easy 9.. as is I cant bring myself above a 7', '2005-02-24 14:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192820, 147934, 34199, '<td valign="top">love it</td>', 'love it', '2005-02-24 14:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192823, 148185, 19010, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the sharing halves. But I do however see the separation.  I feel this is a bit dull and lifeless as is .. The colors don''t pop very well. and the apple is taking on a yellow tinge. maybe my mind is just swimming in the gutter but this seems to have a strong sexual conatation. If so neat.. if not...umm i don''t know what im talking about....</td>', 'I don''t get the sharing halves. But I do however see the separation.  I feel this is a bit dull and lifeless as is .. The colors don''t pop very well. and the apple is taking on a yellow tinge. maybe my mind is just swimming in the gutter but this seems to have a strong sexual conatation. If so neat.. if not...umm i don''t know what im talking about....', '2005-02-24 14:24:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1192827, 147755, 34199, '<td valign="top">amazing</td>', 'amazing', '2005-02-24 14:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192830, 148613, 19010, '<td valign="top">ooooh pretty. I like this shot very nice scenery, wonderfull clouds I think I could realy enjoy the separation that the pilot seems to have from the world up there. Great idea and very nicely executed.. on of my top picks of the challenge.</td>', 'ooooh pretty. I like this shot very nice scenery, wonderfull clouds I think I could realy enjoy the separation that the pilot seems to have from the world up there. Great idea and very nicely executed.. on of my top picks of the challenge.', '2005-02-24 14:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192833, 147908, 19010, '<td valign="top">nope im lost.... yup completely oblivious to the separation you were trying to show.  I do however enjoy the shiney relective thing in the backgroung and the etching on it.. the rest of the shot makes no sense to me..</td>', 'nope im lost.... yup completely oblivious to the separation you were trying to show.  I do however enjoy the shiney relective thing in the backgroung and the etching on it.. the rest of the shot makes no sense to me..', '2005-02-24 14:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192839, 148678, 19010, '<td valign="top">I like it the green and red contrast .. the two walking away from each other. The look on her face.. This is a shot with a story to tell I like the concept. However there are a few things I don''t care for as well the line going across the top of the girls hair. The rocks also are difficult too look at out of focus. I fully understand the reason for having the boy out of focus but it just dosn''t work well for me.. Great shot with a couple of little imperfections.. gets an 8 from me</td>', 'I like it the green and red contrast .. the two walking away from each other. The look on her face.. This is a shot with a story to tell I like the concept. However there are a few things I don''t care for as well the line going across the top of the girls hair. The rocks also are difficult too look at out of focus. I fully understand the reason for having the boy out of focus but it just dosn''t work well for me.. Great shot with a couple of little imperfections.. gets an 8 from me', '2005-02-24 14:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192843, 148999, 32754, '<td valign="top">The colors are like those of an oil painting..just beautiful and soft...this could grace the Sistine chapel ceiling.</td>', 'The colors are like those of an oil painting..just beautiful and soft...this could grace the Sistine chapel ceiling.', '2005-02-24 14:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192844, 148738, 32754, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Just noticed that the guy on the left is doing a little bit of rearing..love the way the black pony''s head is angled.</td>', 'Great shot!  Just noticed that the guy on the left is doing a little bit of rearing..love the way the black pony''s head is angled.', '2005-02-24 14:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192845, 148661, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is a very amusing shot!  I even like the expression on their faces and their positions in the frame for the shot.</td>', 'This is a very amusing shot!  I even like the expression on their faces and their positions in the frame for the shot.', '2005-02-24 14:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192847, 148983, 32754, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot..love the blurred background...positioning of the dog is excellent in shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot..love the blurred background...positioning of the dog is excellent in shot.', '2005-02-24 14:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192852, 148843, 19010, '<td valign="top">ackward and not apealing to me.. the harsh colors of the tree just do not set well for me. While it is an interesting shot I don''t feel it fitts the challenge. Without the title I would have no clue what you were thinking. With the title I feel its a pretty weak connection.  As for the shot itself I feel that more natural lookin wood would have looked better. Or perhaps even a shot from futher way leaving the whole tree as a silloutte.</td>', 'ackward and not apealing to me.. the harsh colors of the tree just do not set well for me. While it is an interesting shot I don''t feel it fitts the challenge. Without the title I would have no clue what you were thinking. With the title I feel its a pretty weak connection.  As for the shot itself I feel that more natural lookin wood would have looked better. Or perhaps even a shot from futher way leaving the whole tree as a silloutte.', '2005-02-24 14:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192867, 148875, 19010, '<td valign="top">umm ok is this two bald heads or a but. I wll start off with saying that at first glance it looks ike a femenin hygen product dangling between the legs.. I hope however and will assume thus that thi is actualy a bald man leaning aginst a mirror. with a crucifix on a chain wedged beteen. I do enjoy the b/w and grainy look that the photo has however. I feel that this could have been a great shot possibly a ribbon contender if it was not so closely framed and gave the veiwer more to interpete the scene.</td>', 'umm ok is this two bald heads or a but. I wll start off with saying that at first glance it looks ike a femenin hygen product dangling between the legs.. I hope however and will assume thus that thi is actualy a bald man leaning aginst a mirror. with a crucifix on a chain wedged beteen. I do enjoy the b/w and grainy look that the photo has however. I feel that this could have been a great shot possibly a ribbon contender if it was not so closely framed and gave the veiwer more to interpete the scene.', '2005-02-24 14:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192897, 148520, 19010, '<td valign="top">ok we have a candle on a peice of ice, on a mirror. While mildly interesting it makes no sense to me.. technicaly it''s ok. it''s in focus, the colors look right, and the rule of 3rds was used.. but alas it looks like a candle on ice on a mirror. There seems to be nothing to it.. I''m not even sure where the separation is that you are trying to portray. is it the fire and ice? The solid to liquid? The two mirrored setup causing a duplicate?. I''m sorry but its just a run of the mill shot that dosn''t fit the challenge to me..</td>', 'ok we have a candle on a peice of ice, on a mirror. While mildly interesting it makes no sense to me.. technicaly it''s ok. it''s in focus, the colors look right, and the rule of 3rds was used.. but alas it looks like a candle on ice on a mirror. There seems to be nothing to it.. I''m not even sure where the separation is that you are trying to portray. is it the fire and ice? The solid to liquid? The two mirrored setup causing a duplicate?. I''m sorry but its just a run of the mill shot that dosn''t fit the challenge to me..', '2005-02-24 15:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192906, 148664, 19010, '<td valign="top">Not a very flattering shot IMO. However the lighting and sapia tones are nice.  Good crisp focus and lots of contrast. In general the shot is great. I feel however that without the title I get no feeling of separation. perhaps if they were separated with the child reacing out for his mother it would ahve worked alot better for me.. as is the separation is weak. The pse is also unflatering the angle look akward on the woman. The childs face looks a little weird.. no offence to the kid or his parents. .. I''m pretty sure it''s just the angle.. different set up and this would have nailed me for a 9 or 10 as is .. better than most but not quite a ribbon.</td>', 'Not a very flattering shot IMO. However the lighting and sapia tones are nice.  Good crisp focus and lots of contrast. In general the shot is great. I feel however that without the title I get no feeling of separation. perhaps if they were separated with the child reacing out for his mother it would ahve worked alot better for me.. as is the separation is weak. The pse is also unflatering the angle look akward on the woman. The childs face looks a little weird.. no offence to the kid or his parents. .. I''m pretty sure it''s just the angle.. different set up and this would have nailed me for a 9 or 10 as is .. better than most but not quite a ribbon.', '2005-02-24 15:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192911, 148662, 19010, '<td valign="top">A majority of the shot is great. The biggest thing that gets my attention as being off is the man. He is waaaaaayy too soft. he apears to be bleeding into the rest of the shot.. other that that its a great shot. The sand a water look great. The pose is pretty good. I think i would like too have seen his face a little though. .. could have been a great shot.. but with the bleeding I can only say it''s pretty good</td>', 'A majority of the shot is great. The biggest thing that gets my attention as being off is the man. He is waaaaaayy too soft. he apears to be bleeding into the rest of the shot.. other that that its a great shot. The sand a water look great. The pose is pretty good. I think i would like too have seen his face a little though. .. could have been a great shot.. but with the bleeding I can only say it''s pretty good', '2005-02-24 15:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192912, 148420, 5354, '<td valign="top">need to make the horizon flat - feels wierd like this</td>', 'need to make the horizon flat - feels wierd like this', '2005-02-24 15:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192914, 148940, 5354, '<td valign="top">Very dark, needs a stop or two on the exposure</td>', 'Very dark, needs a stop or two on the exposure', '2005-02-24 15:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192922, 148987, 19010, '<td valign="top">Not bad just looks like the same shot I''ve seen before. perhaps a broader veiw with the pawn sepated from the rest of the peices would have worked better for me.. As is the DOF is to shallow. I want to see the other peices. It''s a little too dark and the chess board shot from the side at a 30- 45 degree angle seems to have been way over done. I don''t mean to sound harsh but hwen you here even the best of songs on the radio fifteen times a day everyday.. it gets a bit old.. technicaly not a bad photo. I just can''t get interested in it. 5 to remain non bias agaist chess boards.</td>', 'Not bad just looks like the same shot I''ve seen before. perhaps a broader veiw with the pawn sepated from the rest of the peices would have worked better for me.. As is the DOF is to shallow. I want to see the other peices. It''s a little too dark and the chess board shot from the side at a 30- 45 degree angle seems to have been way over done. I don''t mean to sound harsh but hwen you here even the best of songs on the radio fifteen times a day everyday.. it gets a bit old.. technicaly not a bad photo. I just can''t get interested in it. 5 to remain non bias agaist chess boards.', '2005-02-24 15:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192926, 148959, 19010, '<td valign="top">wooo hoo one of my favorite words in the english language.. and it dosn''t fit an a scrabble board.. I feel that your shot represents the feeling of discombobulation and separation very well. You may get voted down for it abstract apearance but you get a 9 from me.</td>', 'wooo hoo one of my favorite words in the english language.. and it dosn''t fit an a scrabble board.. I feel that your shot represents the feeling of discombobulation and separation very well. You may get voted down for it abstract apearance but you get a 9 from me.', '2005-02-24 15:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1192955, 148999, 19010, '<td valign="top">very pretty shot with lots of nice colors but I''m forced to ask where the earth? Without the earth in the shot as a noticable element Iam unable to associate this with separation.. As is without the title I would have no clue what separation you were trying to portray. No separation but a great shot. 6</td>', 'very pretty shot with lots of nice colors but I''m forced to ask where the earth? Without the earth in the shot as a noticable element Iam unable to associate this with separation.. As is without the title I would have no clue what separation you were trying to portray. No separation but a great shot. 6', '2005-02-24 15:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
