(1194200, 148942, 19010, '<td valign="top">I can clearly see the separation. I fee that the liquids and glass were very well shot. My only complaint would be the bottle in back. It seems to serve no pupose and does not enhance the shot IMO. Dreat color and nice sharp focus. Great job.</td>', 'I can clearly see the separation. I fee that the liquids and glass were very well shot. My only complaint would be the bottle in back. It seems to serve no pupose and does not enhance the shot IMO. Dreat color and nice sharp focus. Great job.', '2005-02-25 11:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
