(1194289, 148453, 19010, '<td valign="top">wow what a powerfull image. This was a great find. This fits the challenge well IMO.  The 2 white squares and the lamp post? are a bit bothersom however. I would clone those out after the challnge. Otherwise great shot.</td>', 'wow what a powerfull image. This was a great find. This fits the challenge well IMO.  The 2 white squares and the lamp post? are a bit bothersom however. I would clone those out after the challnge. Otherwise great shot.', '2005-02-25 13:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194297, 148765, 19010, '<td valign="top">A good concept but I feel a closer up shot that was backlit would have worked better for me. I think that if this had shown all of the herbs and seed on the bottom of the bottle this might have been a show stopper. As is I feel it''s pretty average.</td>', 'A good concept but I feel a closer up shot that was backlit would have worked better for me. I think that if this had shown all of the herbs and seed on the bottom of the bottle this might have been a show stopper. As is I feel it''s pretty average.', '2005-02-25 13:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
