(1194454, 147827, 19010, '<td valign="top">Well I must admit I didn''t score this one very high. It just didn''t fit the challenge IMO while I understand the separation you are trying to convey. I don''t feel it convryed the separation well. For me I feel that it needs to show what the duck is separated from. Pehaps a full tub with the duck floating on top. Shot from the side allowing you to see the child with his backturned walking away would have worked. But as is it''s a duck with no separation.</td>', 'Well I must admit I didn''t score this one very high. It just didn''t fit the challenge IMO while I understand the separation you are trying to convey. I don''t feel it convryed the separation well. For me I feel that it needs to show what the duck is separated from. Pehaps a full tub with the duck floating on top. Shot from the side allowing you to see the child with his backturned walking away would have worked. But as is it''s a duck with no separation.', '2005-02-25 14:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194457, 148871, 19010, '<td valign="top">I just dont see the separation in this image perhaps if this was shot at a longer distance I could see the mother trying to separate the child from the toys .. but as it is I just don''t get a feeling of separation. This is a very crisp and clean image. I just feel that it fails to covey the message you were trying to tell.</td>', 'I just dont see the separation in this image perhaps if this was shot at a longer distance I could see the mother trying to separate the child from the toys .. but as it is I just don''t get a feeling of separation. This is a very crisp and clean image. I just feel that it fails to covey the message you were trying to tell.', '2005-02-25 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194481, 148660, 19010, '<td valign="top">I very nice pece that tells a story and conveys your message well. I feel thisfeits the challenge well and was beautifly composed. Two things stand out to me in this shot that realy enhance it. The word death softly written on the wall, and the wonderfull details you oicked up on the coblestone road. The only negative thing I can notice on this is the way the person is positioned against the hole in the wall.  I feel these two aspects are great yet in this pespective they are overwhelming eachother and making it hard to distigish what the are. I think overlooking that this is an easy contender for a ribbon. With it.. it will be tough yet definately a possibity. Great shot kepp up the nice work.</td>', 'I very nice pece that tells a story and conveys your message well. I feel thisfeits the challenge well and was beautifly composed. Two things stand out to me in this shot that realy enhance it. The word death softly written on the wall, and the wonderfull details you oicked up on the coblestone road. The only negative thing I can notice on this is the way the person is positioned against the hole in the wall.  I feel these two aspects are great yet in this pespective they are overwhelming eachother and making it hard to distigish what the are. I think overlooking that this is an easy contender for a ribbon. With it.. it will be tough yet definately a possibity. Great shot kepp up the nice work.', '2005-02-25 15:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
