(1197304, 148633, 6349, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped off the left side and the bottom so that you didn''t see any background.  Other than that, nice lighting and textures.  Good simplicity.</td>', 'I would have cropped off the left side and the bottom so that you didn''t see any background.  Other than that, nice lighting and textures.  Good simplicity.', '2005-02-27 23:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
