(1197310, 148360, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great timing and use of the title to call attention to the theme.  I think it makes a great title that you otherwise wouldn''t have thought of for the photo.  I knew these challenges were good for something.  :)</td>', 'Great timing and use of the title to call attention to the theme.  I think it makes a great title that you otherwise wouldn''t have thought of for the photo.  I knew these challenges were good for something.  :)', '2005-02-27 23:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197315, 148678, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice photo.  The models are nice and well posed.  The background in the top right is a little distracting.  I still feel this is an excellent photo that could me made a top shot with some careful editing.  Take a look at Pedro''s dodge and burn tutorial if you haven''t.  I think this would look great as a black and white using that technique to call attention to the models. 8</td>', 'This is a really nice photo.  The models are nice and well posed.  The background in the top right is a little distracting.  I still feel this is an excellent photo that could me made a top shot with some careful editing.  Take a look at Pedro''s dodge and burn tutorial if you haven''t.  I think this would look great as a black and white using that technique to call attention to the models. 8', '2005-02-27 23:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197317, 148674, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like this and hope it does well here.</td>', 'I really like this and hope it does well here.', '2005-02-27 23:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197318, 148857, 6349, '<td valign="top">I love the subtle colors in this and how well they match and work together throughout the frame.  The shallow depth of field bothers me in the front of the fence though.  8</td>', 'I love the subtle colors in this and how well they match and work together throughout the frame.  The shallow depth of field bothers me in the front of the fence though.  8', '2005-02-27 23:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
