(1197333, 148976, 6349, '<td valign="top">Dude!   This is awesome.  You have no idea how many times I''ve dreamed of doing something like this!  You pulled it off splendidly.  A real ballsy shoot.  I bet you would have scored higher if you were floating out to sea though.  :)</td>', 'Dude!   This is awesome.  You have no idea how many times I''ve dreamed of doing something like this!  You pulled it off splendidly.  A real ballsy shoot.  I bet you would have scored higher if you were floating out to sea though.  :)', '2005-02-28 00:03:16.000000', NULL, 0),
