(1197335, 148425, 17507, '<td valign="top">ahh, Heida it was not, but Iceland. Combination of the characteristic scenery and the human figures dwarfed in a huge landscape makes it look very much like her work.<br/> <br/>This was my pick for first- it''s a great image.</td>', 'ahh, Heida it was not, but Iceland. Combination of the characteristic scenery and the human figures dwarfed in a huge landscape makes it look very much like her work. This was my pick for first- it''s a great image.', '2005-02-28 00:04:57.000000', NULL, 0),
