(1197351, 148463, 6349, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame when photos like this get marked down for washed out skies when the sky is not at all important.  People would think it was great if you shot it in a studio in front of a white background.  Ah well, one of my favorites.</td>', 'It''s a shame when photos like this get marked down for washed out skies when the sky is not at all important.  People would think it was great if you shot it in a studio in front of a white background.  Ah well, one of my favorites.', '2005-02-28 00:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1197352, 148976, 22734, '<td valign="top">Once in a while an image comes along that just blows the majority of the members away. This is one of them. Expertly executed and reminiscent of the Mapp and Lucia series, wherein the dining room table floated away in the water. Much like your image the latter sent me off in stiches. This image is presented here with such atmosphere and untold beauty that after it invokes the laughter we are left with a lovelt and enduring image.<br/> <br/>Hey, Thomas, Congratulations on this brilliant effort. A most deserved blue.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-28 17:00:07.</i></td>', 'Once in a while an image comes along that just blows the majority of the members away. This is one of them. Expertly executed and reminiscent of the Mapp and Lucia series, wherein the dining room table floated away in the water. Much like your image the latter sent me off in stiches. This image is presented here with such atmosphere and untold beauty that after it invokes the laughter we are left with a lovelt and enduring image. Hey, Thomas, Congratulations on this brilliant effort. A most deserved blue.', '2005-02-28 00:10:07.000000', '2005-02-28 17:00:07.000000', 0),
(1197356, 148981, 20779, '<td valign="top">I had this as one of my tens. This was one of the few that touched me.</td>', 'I had this as one of my tens. This was one of the few that touched me.', '2005-02-28 00:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1197357, 148556, 6349, '<td valign="top">By far the best photo in the challenge in my opinion.  Your work continues to inspire me.  This is perfection.</td>', 'By far the best photo in the challenge in my opinion.  Your work continues to inspire me.  This is perfection.', '2005-02-28 00:13:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1197361, 148613, 22734, '<td valign="top">Hey Mark, outstanding as usual. The spatial sense of this image just boggles the mind. There is just so much enjoyment in seeing the tonal values between earth and sky that we need a second visit.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your red.</td>', 'Hey Mark, outstanding as usual. The spatial sense of this image just boggles the mind. There is just so much enjoyment in seeing the tonal values between earth and sky that we need a second visit. Congratulations on your red.', '2005-02-28 00:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1197362, 148976, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well we all knew you had some serious technical skills with your consistently beautiful shots of the same location. Now you''ve showed us you''ve got some equally serious creativity. <br/> <br/>Excellent work!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-28 00:15:11.</i></td>', 'Well we all knew you had some serious technical skills with your consistently beautiful shots of the same location. Now you''ve showed us you''ve got some equally serious creativity.  Excellent work!', '2005-02-28 00:14:27.000000', '2005-02-28 00:15:11.000000', 0),
(1197365, 148981, 6349, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful sher.  sorry you missed what would have been a high vote if I had gotten to it in time.</td>', 'this is beautiful sher.  sorry you missed what would have been a high vote if I had gotten to it in time.', '2005-02-28 00:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1197366, 148925, 20779, '<td valign="top">Thought this would be MUCH higher since it actually made one feel something. This is a great image.</td>', 'Thought this would be MUCH higher since it actually made one feel something. This is a great image.', '2005-02-28 00:15:38.000000', NULL, 0),
