(1197602, 148590, 21072, '<td valign="top">This photo was taken in a mansion that we visited in Werribee, it is open to the public.  I was amazed that the people who used to live there had such little regard for living creatures.  It was obviously a favourite pastime of theirs to go hunting with zebra, lion, bear rugs, and sooo many poor deer heads on the walls.  There was even a side table made out of a hippopotamus head and a stuffed dog!<br/> <br/>Yeah, I know its not the best photo too...</td>', 'This photo was taken in a mansion that we visited in Werribee, it is open to the public.  I was amazed that the people who used to live there had such little regard for living creatures.  It was obviously a favourite pastime of theirs to go hunting with zebra, lion, bear rugs, and sooo many poor deer heads on the walls.  There was even a side table made out of a hippopotamus head and a stuffed dog! Yeah, I know its not the best photo too...', '2005-02-28 00:54:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1197619, 148654, 25232, '<td valign="top">I read the other comments and don''t touch the sign. Maybe tone the color down, but the sign gives the image feeling. Kind of a ageing city or uban decay theme. Papered up windows in a vacant brick building. That is why the bright colors don''t work for me. I would expect something a little less cheery and a little more gray.</td>', 'I read the other comments and don''t touch the sign. Maybe tone the color down, but the sign gives the image feeling. Kind of a ageing city or uban decay theme. Papered up windows in a vacant brick building. That is why the bright colors don''t work for me. I would expect something a little less cheery and a little more gray.', '2005-02-28 00:57:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1197657, 148976, 8367, '<td valign="top">This is amazing! Congratulations on an excellent photo!<br/>I bet your Dad''s beaming, too. :D</td>', 'This is amazing! Congratulations on an excellent photo!I bet your Dad''s beaming, too. :D', '2005-02-28 01:03:32.000000', NULL, 0),
