(1197730, 148976, 22970, '<td valign="top">Zoomdak you did it again, Congratulations!<br/><b>I didn''t vote in the separation challenge because of a time issue setting up a new computer. But wow what as strong image. Some may see a bed in water and thats all, but I see more. Thank you for a wonderful photograph that makes one think and relate.<br/>Great Job!</b></td>', 'Zoomdak you did it again, Congratulations!I didn''t vote in the separation challenge because of a time issue setting up a new computer. But wow what as strong image. Some may see a bed in water and thats all, but I see more. Thank you for a wonderful photograph that makes one think and relate.Great Job!', '2005-02-28 01:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
