(1198034, 148976, 30861, '<td valign="top">Simply outstanding. Liek i said in my comment during the challenge, I''m getting SICK of you and your beach, and even so I gave  it a 10. LOL. You''re doing wonderful work, this shows a depth of imagination and willingness-to-go-the-extra-mile that puts it head and shoulders above the crowd. The score reflects this; it''s so far ahead of the red ribbon it''s not even funny.<br/> <br/>Way to go, dude.<br/> <br/>Robt.</td>', 'Simply outstanding. Liek i said in my comment during the challenge, I''m getting SICK of you and your beach, and even so I gave  it a 10. LOL. You''re doing wonderful work, this shows a depth of imagination and willingness-to-go-the-extra-mile that puts it head and shoulders above the crowd. The score reflects this; it''s so far ahead of the red ribbon it''s not even funny. Way to go, dude. Robt.', '2005-02-28 03:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1198037, 148371, 3306, '<td valign="top">Photoshop was only used to increase contrast, brightness, saturation, crop, and the use of cloning tool to remove some imperfections. The star appearence was achieved by using a small mirror on the apple and a laser light directed at the mirror. A cross screen 4X filter was used on the camera lens.</td>', 'Photoshop was only used to increase contrast, brightness, saturation, crop, and the use of cloning tool to remove some imperfections. The star appearence was achieved by using a small mirror on the apple and a laser light directed at the mirror. A cross screen 4X filter was used on the camera lens.', '2005-02-28 03:19:29.000000', NULL, 0),
