(1198081, 148976, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wow, was not expecting another blue. Thank you everybody for the votes and comments (even you, Robert), very pleased with the placing (and who wouldn''t be). Still a little peeved that I can''t score a dang red or yellow ribbon though, lol. I''d like to give fair share to <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=138966" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">arnit''s ''Surreal Vacuming''</a> for the base of the idea.</td>', 'Wow, was not expecting another blue. Thank you everybody for the votes and comments (even you, Robert), very pleased with the placing (and who wouldn''t be). Still a little peeved that I can''t score a dang red or yellow ribbon though, lol. I''d like to give fair share to arnit''s ''Surreal Vacuming'' for the base of the idea.', '2005-02-28 04:10:38.000000', NULL, 0),
