(1198094, 148425, 20066, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all.  I''m happy with that 7th place.  <br/>A little bit about the picture.  Although it looks a little bit as a photo from Heida I was not at all trying to copy her work or anything.  <br/>I started burning and dodging more than 20 years ago in a darkroom.  <br/>But I think picture like this is much better and much more dramatic if the sky is rather dark but not sterialised white or blue.<br/>And I have some more picture like this one .<a href="//kilimanjaro.heima.is/myndir/botnssulur2005/index.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-28 04:28:29.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all.  I''m happy with that 7th place.  A little bit about the picture.  Although it looks a little bit as a photo from Heida I was not at all trying to copy her work or anything.  I started burning and dodging more than 20 years ago in a darkroom.  But I think picture like this is much better and much more dramatic if the sky is rather dark but not sterialised white or blue.And I have some more picture like this one .here.', '2005-02-28 04:27:32.000000', '2005-02-28 04:28:29.000000', 0),
