(1198805, 148371, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lnede:</b></div><hr/><i> Photoshop was only used to increase contrast, brightness, saturation, crop, and the use of cloning tool to remove some imperfections. The star appearence was achieved by using a small mirror on the apple and a laser light directed at the mirror. A cross screen 4X filter was used on the camera lens. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for the info. It would be <b>very</b> helpful to put stuff like this in the "additional info" field to start with -- that''s what it''s there for. : )</td>', 'Originally posted by lnede: Photoshop was only used to increase contrast, brightness, saturation, crop, and the use of cloning tool to remove some imperfections. The star appearence was achieved by using a small mirror on the apple and a laser light directed at the mirror. A cross screen 4X filter was used on the camera lens.  Thanks for the info. It would be very helpful to put stuff like this in the "additional info" field to start with -- that''s what it''s there for. : )', '2005-02-28 13:14:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1198834, 148976, 19936, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Way to go again!  And for those who are getting tired of the beach" they have to understand that we in the NW never get tired of our natural beauty.  And you have done this beach in so many creative ways.  This site is so humbling; getting beat out consistently by a guy only 17!  What a future.  Congrats.</td>', 'Wow!  Way to go again!  And for those who are getting tired of the beach" they have to understand that we in the NW never get tired of our natural beauty.  And you have done this beach in so many creative ways.  This site is so humbling; getting beat out consistently by a guy only 17!  What a future.  Congrats.', '2005-02-28 13:21:12.000000', NULL, 0),
