(1198904, 148976, 27850, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much for the commentary. I love learning how people set up their shots. I also love the fact that you included the original, so we can see where it came from. A fabulous shot with so much effort put into it. Congratulations on your well-deserved ribbon!<br/></td>', 'Thank you so much for the commentary. I love learning how people set up their shots. I also love the fact that you included the original, so we can see where it came from. A fabulous shot with so much effort put into it. Congratulations on your well-deserved ribbon!', '2005-02-28 13:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
