(1199041, 148435, 23394, '<td valign="top">hey, adi!  great take on the challenge.  i can see how this image may not of worked for a lot of people, but all the same, it is solid entry.  you cleaned up with the commenters, which to me validates your decision to submit it.  unfortunately, i''ve come to accept that with this crowd, anything above a 5 is good news...so, don''t let this one hold you back!  keep on going!<br/> <br/>skip</td>', 'hey, adi!  great take on the challenge.  i can see how this image may not of worked for a lot of people, but all the same, it is solid entry.  you cleaned up with the commenters, which to me validates your decision to submit it.  unfortunately, i''ve come to accept that with this crowd, anything above a 5 is good news...so, don''t let this one hold you back!  keep on going! skip', '2005-02-28 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
