(1199219, 148435, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hey Adi, I gave this image a 6. I definitey got the concept behind it and thought it was pretty good, though I must admit that I tend to be turned off by religious-themed imagery. I think that you might have communicated your idea a bit better by slightly altering your choice of highlight: it might have been better to put the spotlight on "divided the light" or something like that than just "light." Also, another good test I''ve come up with for evaluating images on DPC (or anywhere, really) is: would I put this up on my wall? This image definitely fits the challenge, but despite the fact that you pulled it off well and the technical skill is good, it doesn''t have a lot of out-of-challenge appeal. <br/> <br/>Oh yes, and thank you for your comments on my Castle Rock pictures. I really appreciate the feedback :)<br/> <br/>Damon</td>', 'Hey Adi, I gave this image a 6. I definitey got the concept behind it and thought it was pretty good, though I must admit that I tend to be turned off by religious-themed imagery. I think that you might have communicated your idea a bit better by slightly altering your choice of highlight: it might have been better to put the spotlight on "divided the light" or something like that than just "light." Also, another good test I''ve come up with for evaluating images on DPC (or anywhere, really) is: would I put this up on my wall? This image definitely fits the challenge, but despite the fact that you pulled it off well and the technical skill is good, it doesn''t have a lot of out-of-challenge appeal.  Oh yes, and thank you for your comments on my Castle Rock pictures. I really appreciate the feedback :) Damon', '2005-02-28 15:39:29.000000', NULL, 0),
