(1200306, 148976, 15026, '<td valign="top">I hope you appreciate your father!  I do not think there are many that would be supportive enough to go to that extent despite the value in doing so.  As a relatively new dad, I hope I''m that supportive of my kids and their ambitions when times like these come along.<br/> <br/>With that said, great stuff.  Great idea.  Great vision.  Great execution.<br/> <br/>One question - How far is Cannon Beach from Bandon and Pacific Dunes golf clubs (the name of the third track that opens this year escapes me at the moment)?</td>', 'I hope you appreciate your father!  I do not think there are many that would be supportive enough to go to that extent despite the value in doing so.  As a relatively new dad, I hope I''m that supportive of my kids and their ambitions when times like these come along. With that said, great stuff.  Great idea.  Great vision.  Great execution. One question - How far is Cannon Beach from Bandon and Pacific Dunes golf clubs (the name of the third track that opens this year escapes me at the moment)?', '2005-03-01 00:00:22.000000', NULL, 0),
