(1200611, 148435, 10634, '<td valign="top">Well, I gave you a 6. I think if you had pulled out a bit more so all of the statement could be read, this would have been better understood. In particular, the word "darkness" is almost impossible to read. You could also have tried using the phrase as the title of the photo, but not everyone reads those. I have to say, overall you have a nice range of votes and a good score. I think some of the lower votes can be attributed to those who just plain old vote low and those who didn''t see the meaning of your photo. Good luck!</td>', 'Well, I gave you a 6. I think if you had pulled out a bit more so all of the statement could be read, this would have been better understood. In particular, the word "darkness" is almost impossible to read. You could also have tried using the phrase as the title of the photo, but not everyone reads those. I have to say, overall you have a nice range of votes and a good score. I think some of the lower votes can be attributed to those who just plain old vote low and those who didn''t see the meaning of your photo. Good luck!', '2005-03-01 06:43:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1200706, 148976, 32562, '<td valign="top">I have been to this beach by Heceta Head Lighthouse.  You have captured this wonderful part of the world.  Your photo shows imagination and enjoyment, two factors necessary to stand out in photography.  Great job!</td>', 'I have been to this beach by Heceta Head Lighthouse.  You have captured this wonderful part of the world.  Your photo shows imagination and enjoyment, two factors necessary to stand out in photography.  Great job!', '2005-03-01 08:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1200722, 148875, 3548, '<td valign="top">Separation is in the mind of the beholder.</td>', 'Separation is in the mind of the beholder.', '2005-03-01 08:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1200744, 148502, 28337, '<td valign="top">Great DOF!</td>', 'Great DOF!', '2005-03-01 09:09:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1200754, 148660, 8860, '<td valign="top">Subject: very good and symbolic<br/>Composition: strong main subject, but the person is weak &amp; indistinct in the middle<br/>Editing: don''t like this kind of uber-burning. It''s not well done I''m afraid and, in my view this contrived treatment is eroding DPC<br/> <br/>Well done on your ribbon despite the last point.</td>', 'Subject: very good and symbolicComposition: strong main subject, but the person is weak & indistinct in the middleEditing: don''t like this kind of uber-burning. It''s not well done I''m afraid and, in my view this contrived treatment is eroding DPC Well done on your ribbon despite the last point.', '2005-03-01 09:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
