(1200874, 148976, 11270, '<td valign="top">Wow, you made such an effort, but it paid off getting a blue ribbon, well done. It was so nice to read how you did it and appricate what trouble you went to. Well deserved.<br/>debbie</td>', 'Wow, you made such an effort, but it paid off getting a blue ribbon, well done. It was so nice to read how you did it and appricate what trouble you went to. Well deserved.debbie', '2005-03-01 11:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
