(1200936, 147898, 8367, '<td valign="top">Yeeeee haaaaaa! Fantastic shot.<br/>Congratulations of your high finish in your first challenge.<br/>Looking forward to seeing more of your work. Well done!</td>', 'Yeeeee haaaaaa! Fantastic shot.Congratulations of your high finish in your first challenge.Looking forward to seeing more of your work. Well done!', '2005-03-01 12:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1201022, 148711, 23478, '<td valign="top">Ok, I have no idea why the image feels like the ring is being put on &amp; not taken off... actually it was motionless when the frame was shot:)<br/> <br/>And I agree, the image is technically nice, just lacks some emotion... about the manicure, well, it could just be any person, not necessarily someone upper class.<br/> <br/>I agree that mostly there needed to be someway to inject more emotion into this image.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments.</td>', 'Ok, I have no idea why the image feels like the ring is being put on & not taken off... actually it was motionless when the frame was shot:) And I agree, the image is technically nice, just lacks some emotion... about the manicure, well, it could just be any person, not necessarily someone upper class. I agree that mostly there needed to be someway to inject more emotion into this image. Thanks for all the comments.', '2005-03-01 13:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1201412, 148976, 31738, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on  your Blue. I absolutely loved the idea of this. You put alot of effort into this shot and I have to say your ribbon was well deserved. Four Blues. Good for you!</td>', 'Congratulations on  your Blue. I absolutely loved the idea of this. You put alot of effort into this shot and I have to say your ribbon was well deserved. Four Blues. Good for you!', '2005-03-01 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1201701, 148976, 23944, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Man! you just keep dishin them out  don''t you!? I''ve just added you to my favorites list. Fantastic!</td>', 'Whoa! Man! you just keep dishin them out  don''t you!? I''ve just added you to my favorites list. Fantastic!', '2005-03-01 20:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1201926, 148299, 9581, '<td valign="top">I like the blue in the water. It is a work of art. scotwilson might be right on the jpeg thing or maybe to much on sharpness. Other then that this is still nice and its defanetly got potential.</td>', 'I like the blue in the water. It is a work of art. scotwilson might be right on the jpeg thing or maybe to much on sharpness. Other then that this is still nice and its defanetly got potential.', '2005-03-01 22:36:46.000000', NULL, 0),
