(1202612, 148919, 31637, '<td valign="top">I guess your right vince, this is very clear and sharp, Im a very negative critic....I just want her to know what she did wrong. Im lucky if I even go near a 5 in a challenge? who am I kiddin?</td>', 'I guess your right vince, this is very clear and sharp, Im a very negative critic....I just want her to know what she did wrong. Im lucky if I even go near a 5 in a challenge? who am I kiddin?', '2005-03-02 04:01:36.000000', NULL, 0),
