(1205281, 148991, 34135, '<td valign="top">cool idea - love it.</td>', 'cool idea - love it.', '2005-03-03 10:12:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1205612, 148976, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is great :-) Reminds me of the scene in the movie Eternal Sunshine Of The Spotless Mind. The two main characters woke up with them in their bed at a snow covered beach. After seeing that scene I''ve always imagined of trying something like that.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-03 13:28:36.</i></td>', 'This is great :-) Reminds me of the scene in the movie Eternal Sunshine Of The Spotless Mind. The two main characters woke up with them in their bed at a snow covered beach. After seeing that scene I''ve always imagined of trying something like that.', '2005-03-03 13:26:58.000000', '2005-03-03 13:28:36.000000', 0),
(1206046, 148976, 16780, '<td valign="top">Zoom,<br/> <br/>Each &amp; every shot you take at this location is both breath taking &amp; unique.  This one takes the cake.  Absolutely stunning job!  The talent &amp; creativity you show by being able to create such a portfolio of one location leaves us all wanting to be able to do the same &amp; maybe just a tad jealous ;)<br/>Congrats on another blue. Just keep following your instincts &amp; dreams &amp; you will go as far as you want.  I think I''m almost as proud as your parents are! :o)<br/>  Can they take my kids for just a little while &amp; do whatever it is they did to you??  lol</td>', 'Zoom, Each & every shot you take at this location is both breath taking & unique.  This one takes the cake.  Absolutely stunning job!  The talent & creativity you show by being able to create such a portfolio of one location leaves us all wanting to be able to do the same & maybe just a tad jealous ;)Congrats on another blue. Just keep following your instincts & dreams & you will go as far as you want.  I think I''m almost as proud as your parents are! :o)  Can they take my kids for just a little while & do whatever it is they did to you??  lol', '2005-03-03 17:11:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1206941, 147542, 14986, '<td valign="top">What a cool idea for that challenge.  I agree with the other commenters about the overall poor photo quality, but the idea is the hardest thing to come by imo.  I think you should reshoot this same idea with a better technique.</td>', 'What a cool idea for that challenge.  I agree with the other commenters about the overall poor photo quality, but the idea is the hardest thing to come by imo.  I think you should reshoot this same idea with a better technique.', '2005-03-04 00:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1207003, 147894, 18367, '<td valign="top">I was  stunned at the final score for this photo.  I really liked it and unlike the masses believed it warranted a much higher score, namely a 9.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'I was  stunned at the final score for this photo.  I really liked it and unlike the masses believed it warranted a much higher score, namely a 9. Keep up the good work. Ray', '2005-03-04 01:37:05.000000', NULL, 0),
