(1210048, 147898, 8842, '<td valign="top">This photo kicks ass.  I think this is my favorite submission in this challange.  What greater is there than separation than man from the face of the earth?  Great work.</td>', 'This photo kicks ass.  I think this is my favorite submission in this challange.  What greater is there than separation than man from the face of the earth?  Great work.', '2005-03-06 04:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1210317, 148976, 18080, '<td valign="top">ok, 4 1st places. That''s enough. When you get any other bright ideas like this, e-mail them to me... Only Joking, what a wonderfull image. What i am most puzzled about is why i only gave this shot a 9 and not a 10?<br/>Never mind. Keep up this amazing work.<br/>Kev</td>', 'ok, 4 1st places. That''s enough. When you get any other bright ideas like this, e-mail them to me... Only Joking, what a wonderfull image. What i am most puzzled about is why i only gave this shot a 9 and not a 10?Never mind. Keep up this amazing work.Kev', '2005-03-06 12:51:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1210634, 148261, 33515, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph although I wish I would have cleaned up the gate. I was unsure, and still to be honest, of what I could and could not do to the photo. I though the comments I received were helpful and I look forward to entering more challenges.</td>', 'I really like this photograph although I wish I would have cleaned up the gate. I was unsure, and still to be honest, of what I could and could not do to the photo. I though the comments I received were helpful and I look forward to entering more challenges.', '2005-03-06 17:01:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1210719, 148976, 28261, '<td valign="top">Ok Zoom.  Gotta say I love this.  It reminds me of Storm''s work with Pink Floyd.  Only thing that I would change is a crop that is half way between where you chose (submitted) and where the close up was shot.  He seems just a bit too far away here, but way too close in the close up.<br/> <br/>If the Floyd were planning a tour, this could be the cover and I''d bet even the hardcore fans like me would swear Thorgy took it.  GREAT JOB! and congrats!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-06 18:06:22.</i></td>', 'Ok Zoom.  Gotta say I love this.  It reminds me of Storm''s work with Pink Floyd.  Only thing that I would change is a crop that is half way between where you chose (submitted) and where the close up was shot.  He seems just a bit too far away here, but way too close in the close up. If the Floyd were planning a tour, this could be the cover and I''d bet even the hardcore fans like me would swear Thorgy took it.  GREAT JOB! and congrats!', '2005-03-06 18:05:40.000000', '2005-03-06 18:06:22.000000', 0),
(1210747, 148660, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective! Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Nice perspective! Congrats on the ribbon.', '2005-03-06 18:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1216656, 148991, 9581, '<td valign="top">Mee too :) Why did I ever think I had to smoke 12 years ago ... Cool shot!</td>', 'Mee too :) Why did I ever think I had to smoke 12 years ago ... Cool shot!', '2005-03-09 02:26:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1217446, 148954, 31606, '<td valign="top">By far one of your best.  I can see you are getting better.  Nice shot.</td>', 'By far one of your best.  I can see you are getting better.  Nice shot.', '2005-03-09 11:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1217731, 148976, 33743, '<td valign="top">Zoomdak: I am watching you!  I have read many of the comments written about you and this shot.  To those of us who are fortunate enough to know you personally:  we are all Very Proud of you...and am most curious as to where all of this is going!  Here you are only 17 years old...being raised by the best parents on planet earth...on your way to College (do you really need college?) : you should be teaching them!  I am most proud of you for not neglecting the Gift which HE has placed within you!  Please, keep up the good work...and thank you for inspiring all of us aging baby boomers to aspire to those dreams which we have long since forgotten.  Blessings--bonny in cannon beach</td>', 'Zoomdak: I am watching you!  I have read many of the comments written about you and this shot.  To those of us who are fortunate enough to know you personally:  we are all Very Proud of you...and am most curious as to where all of this is going!  Here you are only 17 years old...being raised by the best parents on planet earth...on your way to College (do you really need college?) : you should be teaching them!  I am most proud of you for not neglecting the Gift which HE has placed within you!  Please, keep up the good work...and thank you for inspiring all of us aging baby boomers to aspire to those dreams which we have long since forgotten.  Blessings--bonny in cannon beach', '2005-03-09 13:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1222113, 147325, 11068, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comments, made a mistake in the title, it should be <br/>tooth fairy.<br/> <br/>(thank you,nards656)</td>', 'thanks for the comments, made a mistake in the title, it should be tooth fairy. (thank you,nards656)', '2005-03-11 18:02:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1222331, 148660, 6306, '<td valign="top">I agree with Imagineer....the composition here is great and the subject is captured well. However, the "uber-burning" of the sky detracts from the effectiveness of the image, causing a beautiful photo to become a cartoon parody of itself.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-11 21:11:14.</i></td>', 'I agree with Imagineer....the composition here is great and the subject is captured well. However, the "uber-burning" of the sky detracts from the effectiveness of the image, causing a beautiful photo to become a cartoon parody of itself.', '2005-03-11 21:10:51.000000', '2005-03-11 21:11:14.000000', 0),
(1222619, 148984, 32409, '<td valign="top">This is way after the challenge and you may not care to hear my thoughts, but I will offer. I gave this shot a 4. I really liked the idea of the shallow depth of field, but it just doesn''t work in this shot. It seems like the DOF is on the fence here. If it were tighter or longer, it would work better. Think of an Oreo commercial, would they have this many crumbs around or flakes on the creamy cookie center? It just seems too contrived of a shot. It seems like it was set up without motive and done just because you got the good angle on the separatated Oreos. (But I know that''s not true.) That being said, I really like the idea of the shot. I think that the lighting is pretty good (which probably is the most important part) but it just didn''t jive with me. Not that my photos are better, but I wanted to try to help out.</td>', 'This is way after the challenge and you may not care to hear my thoughts, but I will offer. I gave this shot a 4. I really liked the idea of the shallow depth of field, but it just doesn''t work in this shot. It seems like the DOF is on the fence here. If it were tighter or longer, it would work better. Think of an Oreo commercial, would they have this many crumbs around or flakes on the creamy cookie center? It just seems too contrived of a shot. It seems like it was set up without motive and done just because you got the good angle on the separatated Oreos. (But I know that''s not true.) That being said, I really like the idea of the shot. I think that the lighting is pretty good (which probably is the most important part) but it just didn''t jive with me. Not that my photos are better, but I wanted to try to help out.', '2005-03-12 03:03:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1223956, 148299, 29079, '<td valign="top">This one looks like a painting, it''s beautiful, lovely colours and I love the shapes of the clouds in the sky</td>', 'This one looks like a painting, it''s beautiful, lovely colours and I love the shapes of the clouds in the sky', '2005-03-13 04:10:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1236058, 148919, 33421, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea</td>', 'Very cool idea', '2005-03-18 10:55:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1247605, 147561, 35122, '<td valign="top">I love this...love the color...very nice...Great Job!!!!</td>', 'I love this...love the color...very nice...Great Job!!!!', '2005-03-24 10:22:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1247619, 148639, 35122, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this pic...I get a feeling of seperation on many different levels...superb!!!  Would get a 10 from me....</td>', 'Absolutely love this pic...I get a feeling of seperation on many different levels...superb!!!  Would get a 10 from me....', '2005-03-24 10:42:47.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1248500, 148875, 10055, '<td valign="top">I get the message here, perhaps I have my own ideas of what it means. here ya go. This person in the photo is feeling seperated from God due to sexural and lustful thought or actions. According a few faiths, sex before marriage, prosituion is a sin and therefore, sin is seperateing Man (women too) from God. The cross is the icon for Jesus. Ta-Da ;) IMOP, very well done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-24 20:54:41.</i></td>', 'I get the message here, perhaps I have my own ideas of what it means. here ya go. This person in the photo is feeling seperated from God due to sexural and lustful thought or actions. According a few faiths, sex before marriage, prosituion is a sin and therefore, sin is seperateing Man (women too) from God. The cross is the icon for Jesus. Ta-Da ;) IMOP, very well done.', '2005-03-24 20:53:31.000000', '2005-03-24 20:54:41.000000', 0),
(1298729, 148937, 1717, '<td valign="top">a very heartbreaking image for me but it also brings forth wonderful memories of my dad.  thank you for sharing this.</td>', 'a very heartbreaking image for me but it also brings forth wonderful memories of my dad.  thank you for sharing this.', '2005-04-17 23:15:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1337856, 148915, 24128, '<td valign="top">I think that you could have rotated the image slightly to the left to fill the frame a little more. You need to have a larger dof (try f11 at the same focal length) in order to ensure that both the flowers are clearly in focus, then with a little sharpening combined such a beatuful background this image would be very impressive.</td>', 'I think that you could have rotated the image slightly to the left to fill the frame a little more. You need to have a larger dof (try f11 at the same focal length) in order to ensure that both the flowers are clearly in focus, then with a little sharpening combined such a beatuful background this image would be very impressive.', '2005-04-28 13:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1362159, 148710, 9581, '<td valign="top">Tell me did you do this for real or did you edit in photoshop? Its totally inspiring and awesome... Though if the black or dark like shadow could go all around the coin leaving it framed maybe this could be a bit better.. I still like though :)</td>', 'Tell me did you do this for real or did you edit in photoshop? Its totally inspiring and awesome... Though if the black or dark like shadow could go all around the coin leaving it framed maybe this could be a bit better.. I still like though :)', '2005-05-05 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1449205, 148580, 36469, '<td valign="top">amen, brutha<br/>I always want to throw something when working with glass<br/>i would''ve liked to see more of the glass, since the top of it fades out to white. love the colours you chose, they came out great. Also another idea, maybe a darker background with a spotlight effect centered right behind the glass? Does that make any sense? Sometimes I''d get thin poster board and place a track light behind it with coloured paper over the light, looks really cool!</td>', 'amen, bruthaI always want to throw something when working with glassi would''ve liked to see more of the glass, since the top of it fades out to white. love the colours you chose, they came out great. Also another idea, maybe a darker background with a spotlight effect centered right behind the glass? Does that make any sense? Sometimes I''d get thin poster board and place a track light behind it with coloured paper over the light, looks really cool!', '2005-06-12 14:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1452864, 148990, 1717, '<td valign="top">oh yeah...i like this one a lot!  the composition is great and i love the tone you chose.  what kind of little buildings are these?</td>', 'oh yeah...i like this one a lot!  the composition is great and i love the tone you chose.  what kind of little buildings are these?', '2005-06-13 18:24:38.000000', NULL, 0),
